From d150712afd4a5b9eeaee773b08f51c6a9c2bf481 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rahul Ganesh <rahulgab@amazon.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Jan 2026 16:46:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Remove secondstar service

EKS-A does not use the secondstar (SSH over serial) service. Disable it.

Note: tootles (metadata service, formerly hegel) is kept as EKS-A uses
it for machine metadata.

Signed-off-by: Rahul Ganesh <rahulgab@amazon.com>
---
 cmd/tinkerbell/cmd.go             | 39 +------------------
 cmd/tinkerbell/defaults.go        |  1 -
 cmd/tinkerbell/flag/global.go     |  7 ----
 cmd/tinkerbell/flag/secondstar.go | 64 -------------------------------
 cmd/tinkerbell/helpers.go         | 11 +-----
 5 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 119 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 cmd/tinkerbell/flag/secondstar.go

